# Accessibility

Icon-only controls: `accessibilityRole="button"` + `accessibilityLabel`. No unlabeled lucide `Pressable`.

Unread / online must not be color-only — keep the unread count pill; don’t drop text for a green dot alone.

Don’t set `accessible={false}` on tappable rows. Hit target ≥ 44.

Composer `TextInput`: `accessibilityLabel` (e.g. `"Message"`).

```tsx
// BAD
<Pressable onPress={onPress}><Plus /></Pressable>

// GOOD
<Pressable
  accessibilityRole="button"
  accessibilityLabel="Attach"
  onPress={onPress}
>
  <Plus />
</Pressable>
```
